# EmailJS (https://www.emailjs.com/) — free tier sends from the browser using a template.
# Create a service + email template. Use these variable names in the template body:
#   {{reply_email}}  — sender’s address (use as Reply-To if your provider supports it)
#   {{subject}}
#   {{message}}      — full body (for bug reports this includes appended game JSON)
#   {{to_email}}     — optional; this app sets it to david@decoybecoy.com
# Set the template’s “To” field to david@decoybecoy.com (or bind it to {{to_email}}).

VITE_EMAILJS_PUBLIC_KEY=
VITE_EMAILJS_SERVICE_ID=
VITE_EMAILJS_TEMPLATE_ID=
